{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321250/extras/c1ab34a9476c4cc81b67353670d4cc1a.avif?t=1759169983\" width=1000 height=332 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a\u00a0SUPERCORGI!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <i>Corgi Butt Power</i> to use corgi superpowers to climb and soar and prove  stubby legs can't stop you on your climb to <i>Serenity Summit!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be a Corgi Unleashed!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Grico Island</i> has 4 different resorts for you to play and relax in! They're all in an open world. Freely travel between them and discover or unlock shortcuts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321250/extras/ebe0a61f3c062ae551001539ab7aefc0.poster.avif?t=1759169983\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321250/extras/ebe0a61f3c062ae551001539ab7aefc0.webm?t=1759169983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321250/extras/ebe0a61f3c062ae551001539ab7aefc0.mp4?t=1759169983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your own path around the island and explore your way. Relax at cozy spots, grow your collections, or talk to locals. It's all <strong> your</strong> choice. You can even toggle the pixelized <i>Nostalgia Mode</i> on or off in the settings of the game! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Teach people to Live Like A Dog!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321250/extras/ec3934eb3d18fd089b4b65613759000f.poster.avif?t=1759169983\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321250/extras/ec3934eb3d18fd089b4b65613759000f.webm?t=1759169983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321250/extras/ec3934eb3d18fd089b4b65613759000f.mp4?t=1759169983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You're man's best friend for a reason. Help islanders with their problems, just like dogs do! Teach them to enjoy the little things and love unconditionally.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relax at secret Cozy Spots</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the serenity of the island\u2019s natural beauty at special cozy spots. Put your controller down and delight in the peaceful music and animations. Maybe now\u2019s a good time to do that work you've been putting off or do some creative journaling or drawing?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321250/extras/3094041ccbee5acde1d6f83577e05843.poster.avif?t=1759169983\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321250/extras/3094041ccbee5acde1d6f83577e05843.webm?t=1759169983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321250/extras/3094041ccbee5acde1d6f83577e05843.mp4?t=1759169983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Your Appearance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My corgi is Corgster, a Pembroke Welsh good boy. What type of corgi will <strong>you</strong> be? Tri-color?  Blue Merle?, or more? Want Hats, Glasses, Shirts, or Capes? Yes, please!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hint: you can change your Corgi Coat using a secret method in the intro area (The Doggy Bowl). Can you figure it out?\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can you pet the dog?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Well... you ARE the dog! Let people pet YOU! Boop other dogs you find, too!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Our Mission</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We make games that make a difference. We wanted to give people a fun, relaxing way to help real dogs. And, 10% of all proceeds donate to shelters to sponsor rescue dogs! We appreciate your support :) We also intend for our games to heal players. Life is stressful. Be a dog for a few hours, it helps!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Follow our Scalisco Developer Steam Page\u00a0</strong><i>(click our developer name, Scalisco, at the top of page) </i> so you know when we release more games that help us donate to help animals and other causes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our wholesome community on Discord\u00a0(check the links on the side of the page).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit  to see our corgi merch and mobile games that also help us donate to animal shelters. Thank you!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Best Fertilizer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2321250/8ead35e77c23c7b2ee6f240f92fc190544332fde.jpg"},{"name":"Hot Dog!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2321250/275efd0dd52863dd085f33b793def35555367040.jpg"},{"name":"Corgi Coat Connoisseur","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2321250/3724044f39cdd3460c31dc4592f97b9ad197cc8d.jpg"},{"name":"Diary Snooper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2321250/02029e77691f2896d911a99ec295bbdbe8ef3a0a.jpg"},{"name":"Visit The Doggy Bowl","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2321250/fbe5b83d6a7f3ab75ae2e5f1932